1
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:16,040
All rise!

2
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:22,360
Get seated.

3
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:35,180
Trial in Seoul District Court begins now.

4
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:41,120
Case 521, a hit-and-run.

5
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:44,810
Defendant Kang Yoo Jung, please stand over there.

6
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:18,490
If you have called an ambulance,

7
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:21,110
you could've save their lives.

8
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:25,510
Due to denfendant Kang Yoo Jung's irresponsible act,

9
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:29,130
a young woman and

10
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:35,240
her unborn child were dead.

11
00:01:35,820 --> 00:01:40,830
This is inexcusable under any circumstances.

12
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:47,740
Therefore, we presecutor ask for

13
00:01:53,210 --> 00:01:56,060
a five-year sentence to defendant Kang Yoo Jung.

14
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:26,150
Number 2008, get in.

15
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,500
Honey.

16
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,520
Move.

17
00:04:25,980 --> 00:04:29,950
Hey, isn't she Ye Ji, the movie star?

18
00:04:30,610 --> 00:04:32,960
She's my target.

19
00:04:33,010 --> 00:04:34,800
Stay away from her.

20
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,830
I'm a big fan of yours.

21
00:04:52,830 --> 00:04:55,020
Can I have your autograph?

22
00:05:08,850 --> 00:05:15,820
Sorry, can I have your autograph, too?

23
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:20,410
Hey!

24
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:31,140
So boring.

25
00:06:35,570 --> 00:06:37,220
Honey.

26
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:40,320
Honey! Where are you?

27
00:06:42,290 --> 00:06:47,300
Do you like playing hide-and-seek?

28
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:02,960
Miss, go drink with me.

29
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:08,250
Go away.

30
00:07:21,890 --> 00:07:23,420
Why is he looking at me that way?

31
00:07:25,170 --> 00:07:26,460
Yoo Jung.

32
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:29,290
Are you available now?

33
00:07:29,290 --> 00:07:30,110
Yes.

34
00:07:30,110 --> 00:07:33,720
Two customers called me just now, wanna take one?

35
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:37,880
Sure. Thank you. What's the phone number?

36
00:07:39,610 --> 00:07:42,150
It's a male customer, can you handle it?

37
00:07:42,150 --> 00:07:43,120
Sure.

38
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,580
See you later.

39
00:07:45,250 --> 00:07:48,270
I'll be back soon, wait for me!

40
00:07:50,460 --> 00:07:51,810
Hello.

41
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:56,600
Hey. Hurry up.

42
00:07:57,170 --> 00:08:00,760
This is the address. Go as quickly as possible.

43
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,840
- Thank you. - Be careful.

44
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:02,670
OK.

45
00:08:08,390 --> 00:08:11,330
Sir, fasten your seatbelt please.

46
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:35,770
What are you doing?

47
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,630
I'm your designated driver.

48
00:08:39,630 --> 00:08:40,980
Where is the former guy?

49
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:43,240
I don't know.

50
00:08:44,450 --> 00:08:47,410
What should I do with this? I seemed to press the wrong button.

51
00:08:47,410 --> 00:08:48,990
Leave it alone.

52
00:08:55,050 --> 00:08:57,120
We're off then.

53
00:09:43,230 --> 00:09:44,330
Stop.

54
00:09:44,330 --> 00:09:44,860
What?

55
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:46,520
Stop the car!

56
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:06,240
Stop the car! Stop.

57
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,390
Get out of the way.

58
00:10:56,430 --> 00:10:57,650
What are you doing?

59
00:10:57,650 --> 00:10:58,630
Go away.

60
00:10:58,860 --> 00:10:59,760
Sir.

61
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:01,410
Don't let me say the same thing twice.

62
00:11:01,410 --> 00:11:02,890
Go away or I'll hit you.

63
00:11:02,890 --> 00:11:05,880
How can you be so rude!

64
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,110
That's who I am.

65
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:11,310
What are you doing?

66
00:11:11,310 --> 00:11:13,740
You're still drunk. You can't drive.

67
00:11:13,740 --> 00:11:18,080
Some people have to earn money while others are asleep.

68
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:20,420
They can't risk a car accident.

69
00:11:20,420 --> 00:11:23,160
So what?

70
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,320
Give me the key.

71
00:11:25,500 --> 00:11:26,420
Aren't you ashamed?

72
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:27,940
Call another designated driver or walk home.

73
00:11:27,940 --> 00:11:30,460
Give me the key. Give it to me.

74
00:11:38,310 --> 00:11:40,400
Holy crap.

75
00:11:47,830 --> 00:11:50,570
It seems like you don't want to call another driver,

76
00:11:54,770 --> 00:11:56,060
maybe you should walk home.

77
00:11:56,060 --> 00:11:57,740
Come here.

78
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,540
Kwang Soo!

79
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,870
My phone.

80
00:12:18,450 --> 00:12:22,370
Is that guy crazy?

81
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:25,820
Why didn't you call Do Hoon?

82
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:27,380
He is a prosecutor.

83
00:12:27,380 --> 00:12:32,490
No. He doesn't know that I'm a designated driver. I won't tell him.

84
00:12:32,490 --> 00:12:36,970
What an innocent girl.

85
00:12:36,970 --> 00:12:39,740
You can tell from his behaviours.

86
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:43,940
He must be a sopiled rich guy. Find out where he lives.

87
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:47,370
If I were you, I won't let him go.

88
00:12:47,370 --> 00:12:51,360
I'll get a large sum of money, or seduce him.

89
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:53,680
Seduce him?

90
00:12:55,260 --> 00:12:57,800
Don't you just start a new relationship?

91
00:12:57,800 --> 00:13:02,020
Don't be so naive. We should always seek for the best boyfriend.

92
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:04,650
You should be careful, it's not rare to find

93
00:13:04,650 --> 00:13:08,550
a girl who work for her boyfriend to school and then be abandoned.

94
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:12,860
I won't be with him for 7 years if he were that kind of boy.

95
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:16,560
Is everything ok with your boyfriend?

96
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,700
Just worry about yourself.

97
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:24,050
You've been together for 7 years.

98
00:13:24,050 --> 00:13:27,330
Even if you were as pretty as me, men would still be bored with you.

99
00:13:27,330 --> 00:13:30,350
Men are always looking for new targets.

100
00:13:30,350 --> 00:13:34,420
Look, you can't even call him when you need him.

101
00:13:34,420 --> 00:13:36,990
I can, but I don't want to.

102
00:13:36,990 --> 00:13:40,280
Really?

103
00:13:41,950 --> 00:13:47,340
Ji Hee! Seo Ji Hee!

104
00:13:48,530 --> 00:13:51,260
Seo Ji Hee!

105
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:36,500
Darling.

106
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:39,000
Wake up.

107
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,750
Ji Hee!

108
00:14:46,300 --> 00:14:48,570
I am so sleepy.

109
00:14:48,570 --> 00:14:49,940
So sleepy.

110
00:14:49,940 --> 00:14:51,410
Wake up! Let's go.

111
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:54,390
Five more minutes.

112
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:56,360
Wake up! Be quick.

113
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,870
I'm so tired.

114
00:14:57,870 --> 00:15:02,140
Get up and have the breakfast. Come on.

115
00:15:02,140 --> 00:15:06,020
Why do you get up so early?

116
00:15:06,020 --> 00:15:08,060
Sit.

117
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:10,060
I'm so sleepy.

118
00:15:10,060 --> 00:15:13,110
I don't want to take the breakfast.

119
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,910
It's aromatic.

120
00:15:19,910 --> 00:15:23,230
That's why I like to be here.

121
00:15:27,060 --> 00:15:29,240
Water, Water.

122
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:34,450
Water.

123
00:15:37,420 --> 00:15:38,880
Give me some water.

124
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:45,560
You did it on purpose. Come over here.

125
00:15:48,450 --> 00:15:54,210
You did it on purporse, right? My mouth is burning.

126
00:15:57,540 --> 00:16:00,900
I want to make your heart burning.

127
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:07,370
You always come to me late at night, I hate you.

128
00:16:07,370 --> 00:16:10,690
It's so spicy!

129
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,610
Give me some water.

130
00:16:15,610 --> 00:16:18,390
Water.

131
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:23,860
I should stop hating you and love you again.

132
00:16:52,450 --> 00:16:54,250
Min Hyuk!

133
00:16:54,250 --> 00:16:57,200
Your father is looking for you.

134
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,560
- If he knew you were here. - Have you found her?

135
00:17:00,890 --> 00:17:02,730
She has left Daejeon.

136
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,600
Now we are looking for her in Suwon.

137
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:09,870
Sorry.

138
00:17:09,870 --> 00:17:12,480
Don't say sorry. Go find her.

139
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:17,060
Get out.

140
00:17:32,870 --> 00:17:34,350
I am

141
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:38,330
a prosecutor who help people in need.

142
00:17:38,330 --> 00:17:41,980
I only strive to find the truth and justice.

143
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:48,170
I swear to be an upright presecutor.

144
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:18,290
Where have you been?

145
00:18:18,290 --> 00:18:18,990
Where is father?

146
00:18:18,990 --> 00:18:20,940
- What? - Is he out?

147
00:18:20,940 --> 00:18:22,240
I don't know.

148
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:26,070
What a brat! Go to school.

149
00:18:26,070 --> 00:18:30,730
Who do you think you are!

150
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:33,850
8.74 million KRW.

151
00:18:33,850 --> 00:18:38,380
These are the fines issued to your car last month.

152
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:44,540
24.5 million KRW, for hotel room charges,

153
00:18:44,540 --> 00:18:47,170
and the clothes that you bought for your lady friends.

154
00:18:47,170 --> 00:18:51,610
You don't have moeny to buy your own underwear.

155
00:18:51,610 --> 00:18:55,510
I have raised you to this age, even if you can't help me to run the company,

156
00:18:55,510 --> 00:18:58,650
you should at least not embarrass me.

157
00:18:59,450 --> 00:19:02,410
Tell your brother to come back to Seoul.

158
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:06,240
The resort in Cheongju is running well now.

159
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:10,480
He'll be in charge of the hotel.

160
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:14,250
You can take charge of the casino and the theater.

161
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:16,030
Darling. - Father.

162
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:21,360
Apologize to Congressman Shin, and cancel the engagement.

163
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:26,360
It's my fault to spoil him.

164
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:31,230
Get out. I have nothing to say to you.

165
00:19:31,230 --> 00:19:33,090
Darling.

166
00:19:33,090 --> 00:19:38,280
Min Hyuk has already bought an engagement ring for Se Yeon.

167
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:43,560
He must feel awkward to be engaged with his friend at first.

168
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:45,630
Se Yeon is arriving today, right?

169
00:19:45,630 --> 00:19:49,460
I told Congressman Shin that we'd go pick her up at the airport.

170
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:51,340
Are you going to pick her up?

171
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:56,270
Of course. I should go pick up Se Yeon.

172
00:19:56,780 --> 00:19:59,120
Forgive him.

173
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:00,270
He's still young.

174
00:20:00,270 --> 00:20:02,580
He'll grow up when he gets married.

175
00:20:02,580 --> 00:20:05,690
I'm aware of that.

176
00:20:17,250 --> 00:20:18,860
Min Hyuk.

177
00:20:18,860 --> 00:20:21,760
Are you going to the airport?

178
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:25,920
You should take the ring.

179
00:20:30,210 --> 00:20:35,620
I can tolerate you act like that when my father is around,

180
00:20:35,620 --> 00:20:38,770
but don't smile and speak like that when no one is here.

181
00:20:38,770 --> 00:20:41,660
It makes me feel sick.

182
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:47,710
Min Hyuk, don't you know how to say thank you?

183
00:20:47,990 --> 00:20:49,150
Good-bye.

184
00:20:49,150 --> 00:20:51,720
OK.

185
00:20:55,980 --> 00:21:00,650
Thanks. Here's your receipt and 2400KRW.

186
00:21:00,650 --> 00:21:03,540
Drive safely.

187
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:06,470
Hello.

188
00:21:07,290 --> 00:21:08,270
Thank you.

189
00:21:08,270 --> 00:21:10,520
Put that in the garbage.

190
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:14,510
- OK. Here you are. - Thanks.

191
00:21:14,510 --> 00:21:17,760
Drive safely.

192
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:27,990
Look how greedy you eat.

193
00:21:27,990 --> 00:21:30,280
Don't eat so fast.

194
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:32,720
Drive safely.

195
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:34,640
It’s too much for you to eat. I'll help you to finish it.

196
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:39,230
Don't be so stingy.

197
00:21:39,230 --> 00:21:42,080
Rich people spend money like nothing.

198
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:44,070
I suffered a lot, but still have no money.

199
00:21:44,070 --> 00:21:47,870
Don't be kidding. You’ve spent all your money on making up and buying clothes.

200
00:21:47,870 --> 00:21:49,910
Do you call that suffer?

201
00:21:49,910 --> 00:21:53,360
- Look at Yoo Jung. She works day and night. - Yes.

202
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:54,930
For her dear boyfriend.

203
00:21:54,930 --> 00:21:58,200
She's penniless aftre working for 10 years.

204
00:21:58,200 --> 00:22:01,160
Yesterday, she...

205
00:22:02,210 --> 00:22:04,050
Isn't it delicious?

206
00:22:04,050 --> 00:22:07,490
Where are we having dinner tonight? Potato soup again?

207
00:22:07,490 --> 00:22:08,910
I don’t know.

208
00:22:08,910 --> 00:22:10,200
I can’t go anyway.

209
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,280
Why?

210
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:16,880
It's an important day.

211
00:22:21,530 --> 00:22:24,150
Haven't seen you for a long time, Se Yeon.

212
00:22:25,470 --> 00:22:27,170
What are you doing here?

213
00:22:27,170 --> 00:22:29,180
What can I do at the airport except for picking you up?

214
00:22:29,180 --> 00:22:32,130
This is for you, the ring.

215
00:22:32,130 --> 00:22:35,540
We’ve been friends since we were kids.

216
00:22:35,540 --> 00:22:38,430
How can we be married?

217
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:42,930
Don't wanna take it?

218
00:22:42,930 --> 00:22:44,560
Don't marry me if you don't want to.

219
00:22:44,560 --> 00:22:47,430
Don’t use your father as an excuse.

220
00:22:47,430 --> 00:22:49,360
I never said I didn’t want to marry you.

221
00:22:49,360 --> 00:22:50,820
Why wouldn’t I like it?

222
00:22:50,820 --> 00:22:54,620
The presecutors always investigate us due to the petty cash.

223
00:22:54,620 --> 00:22:57,360
If I married you, your father will help us out.

224
00:22:57,360 --> 00:22:59,270
We can sponsor your father financially.

225
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:01,920
This is a win-win situation.

226
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:04,080
We're marrying for the benefit of our families.

227
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:06,320
It's better to marry you than a total stranger.

228
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:08,850
Is that all?

229
00:23:08,850 --> 00:23:12,400
What else? Just take it.

230
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:13,460
It's very expensive.

231
00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:16,680
No doubt. All you have is money.

232
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:19,040
Then why not accept it?

233
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:21,350
I'll throw it away.

234
00:23:21,970 --> 00:23:24,710
Is it that cheap in your eyes?

235
00:23:25,210 --> 00:23:27,790
Then throw it away.

236
00:23:37,370 --> 00:23:39,830
What should we do?

237
00:23:39,830 --> 00:23:41,890
Just tell your father that you don’t want to marry me.

238
00:23:41,890 --> 00:23:42,710
What if I do?

239
00:23:42,710 --> 00:23:44,980
I'll do whatever you want.

240
00:23:44,980 --> 00:23:46,760
I can’t tell my father.

241
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:48,660
If I told him that I won't marry you,

242
00:23:48,660 --> 00:23:51,890
he'll beat me to death.

243
00:23:51,890 --> 00:23:55,510
Your father doesn’t like me, either.

244
00:23:55,510 --> 00:23:59,880
Even if you are a rogue, it doesn’t matter to him.

245
00:23:59,880 --> 00:24:02,540
He needs your father's money.

246
00:24:02,540 --> 00:24:06,100
What a bad day!

247
00:24:06,100 --> 00:24:09,390
You don’t want to live with me, right?

248
00:24:09,390 --> 00:24:13,620
Can you imagine us sleeping together?

249
00:24:14,840 --> 00:24:16,620
You smiled.

250
00:24:16,620 --> 00:24:22,080
You will break off the engagement, right?

251
00:24:27,190 --> 00:24:31,490
Hello. I'm Number 8 staff.

252
00:24:33,570 --> 00:24:38,440
Hey, you work here.

253
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:41,820
The toll is 8000KRW.

254
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:46,360
I didn’t bring my wallet.

255
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:49,280
I'll send the bill to your company,

256
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:50,670
or you can go to the office over there.

257
00:24:50,670 --> 00:24:54,380
Thanks to you, I dind't drive after drinking.

258
00:24:54,380 --> 00:24:56,200
Thank you.

259
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:58,290
I'll send the bill to your address.

260
00:24:58,290 --> 00:25:00,410
You still owe me 15000KRW for last night.

261
00:25:00,410 --> 00:25:02,690
You are asking me to pay for you?

262
00:25:02,690 --> 00:25:04,690
You'll be rich one day.

263
00:25:04,690 --> 00:25:06,200
But, I don’t have any money.

264
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:07,700
Can you lend me some?

265
00:25:07,700 --> 00:25:08,400
What?

266
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:09,800
How much?

267
00:25:09,970 --> 00:25:12,230
Don't bother. I'll pay her.

268
00:25:12,630 --> 00:25:14,700
I don’t like being in debt.

269
00:25:15,320 --> 00:25:17,430
Hold this as collateral.

270
00:25:18,150 --> 00:25:19,630
What are you doing?

271
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:21,150
Since you didn't want it.

272
00:25:23,510 --> 00:25:26,220
Take this as collateral.

273
00:25:26,220 --> 00:25:27,030
Sir!

274
00:25:27,030 --> 00:25:29,540
The customer is always right, right?

275
00:25:30,130 --> 00:25:31,910
You should listen to the customer.

276
00:25:33,590 --> 00:25:34,320
Take it.

277
00:25:35,520 --> 00:25:36,290
Nice catch.

278
00:25:36,290 --> 00:25:37,570
Hey!

279
00:25:37,750 --> 00:25:39,040
Min Hyuk!

280
00:25:44,880 --> 00:25:47,120
Take care of it. I'll come back for it.

281
00:25:47,120 --> 00:25:49,330
You not only don't respect money,

282
00:25:51,960 --> 00:25:54,590
but also have no respect for other.

283
00:25:56,330 --> 00:25:57,420
You're right.

284
00:25:57,480 --> 00:25:58,980
Stop tapping my window.

285
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:00,820
See you later.

286
00:26:02,490 --> 00:26:04,710
Hey, hey...

287
00:26:05,760 --> 00:26:09,020
Stop!

288
00:26:11,820 --> 00:26:12,970
Sorry.

289
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:15,380
Sorry, sir.

290
00:26:17,320 --> 00:26:19,510
I'm sorry. OK.

291
00:26:24,350 --> 00:26:25,560
What do you want to do?

292
00:26:25,760 --> 00:26:27,060
You don’t want the ring,

293
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,780
but you don’t want anyone else to have it?

294
00:26:28,860 --> 00:26:32,580
Do you think I'll care about that ring?

295
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:38,110
You used the ring to embarrass me in front of that kind of girl.

296
00:26:38,390 --> 00:26:42,720
That's Se Yeon.

297
00:26:42,720 --> 00:26:43,820
Sorry.

298
00:27:04,620 --> 00:27:07,900
Yoo Jung, are those real diamonds?

299
00:27:07,900 --> 00:27:09,750
Can I try it on?

300
00:27:10,090 --> 00:27:11,720
It doesn't belong to us.

301
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,450
I may never have the chance to wear a ring like this.

302
00:27:13,450 --> 00:27:14,680
Let me put it on just once.

303
00:27:15,070 --> 00:27:17,070
- No. - Just once.

304
00:27:17,070 --> 00:27:18,490
Please.

305
00:27:20,980 --> 00:27:23,570
You baked a cake for your anniversary.

306
00:27:25,310 --> 00:27:28,400
Why not give him a gift certificate or a smart phone?

307
00:27:29,110 --> 00:27:30,880
There’s nothing special about that.

308
00:27:30,880 --> 00:27:32,860
This is different.

309
00:27:33,300 --> 00:27:36,490
You're paying too much.

310
00:27:36,700 --> 00:27:38,820
Did he call you even once today?

311
00:27:39,700 --> 00:27:41,870
See! He didn’t call you.

312
00:27:41,870 --> 00:27:44,280
Why do you bother taking this to him?

313
00:27:44,350 --> 00:27:46,780
Let's just eat it here.

314
00:27:46,780 --> 00:27:48,230
Hey! Hae Ri!

315
00:27:49,500 --> 00:27:52,680
Before I hurt you, hand that box to me.

316
00:27:54,450 --> 00:27:56,790
Sorry, here you are.

317
00:28:00,100 --> 00:28:01,900
You'd better pray for it to be intact.

318
00:28:28,250 --> 00:28:30,530
Hello. I’m Ahn Do Hoon.

319
00:28:30,850 --> 00:28:33,930
You’re quite handsome for a prosecutor.

320
00:28:42,860 --> 00:28:45,670
You can leave a voice mail.

321
00:28:45,670 --> 00:28:48,850
Hello, Do Hoon. Have you been busy?

322
00:28:49,310 --> 00:28:53,580
It’s okay. What time should we meet each other?

323
00:28:53,930 --> 00:28:56,200
Okay.

324
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:24,460
How come she's not calling me?

325
00:29:24,460 --> 00:29:25,660
What a torture.

326
00:29:28,320 --> 00:29:31,790
What did they say?

327
00:29:32,060 --> 00:29:34,470
I'm sure they liked Do Hoon.

328
00:29:36,290 --> 00:29:38,400
- What? - Yes.

329
00:29:40,510 --> 00:29:42,870
Enough.

330
00:29:42,870 --> 00:29:49,120
Of course. Why bother saying so much.

331
00:29:49,620 --> 00:29:51,930
Don't worry about it.

332
00:29:52,250 --> 00:29:54,760
- Do Hoon is smart. - Who is that?

333
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:58,660
-Passing the bar exam was a piece of cake for him. - Hello, you're home.

334
00:29:58,660 --> 00:30:00,180
Yoo Jung!

335
00:30:00,180 --> 00:30:03,050
- Others can't compare with him - Why do you bring so many things?

336
00:30:03,050 --> 00:30:05,250
- Come in. It must be heavy. - Yes.

337
00:30:06,790 --> 00:30:07,910
Mother, how are you?

338
00:30:07,910 --> 00:30:09,060
Right.

339
00:30:09,580 --> 00:30:15,650
Madam Park, let me know when you find out.

340
00:30:17,710 --> 00:30:20,620
What are you doing here? Do Hoon will come home late today.

341
00:30:20,620 --> 00:30:23,190
I come here to see you two.

342
00:30:25,020 --> 00:30:26,650
The pumpkin is very sweet.

343
00:30:29,370 --> 00:30:31,570
This is entrepreneur.

344
00:30:37,860 --> 00:30:42,750
You don’t have to do that. Do Hoon will eat out tonight.

345
00:30:42,750 --> 00:30:45,070
Father coughs a lot recently.

346
00:30:45,070 --> 00:30:47,480
We can steam it as a snack.

347
00:30:47,480 --> 00:30:49,780
This can cure constipation. You should try some.

348
00:30:49,780 --> 00:30:52,850
You don’t have to do this. No one will eat it.

349
00:30:52,850 --> 00:30:56,100
It's almost done. Don't worry and have a rest.

350
00:30:56,840 --> 00:31:00,100
I can't rest when an outsider is working in my kitchen.

351
00:31:00,100 --> 00:31:02,180
How can I be an outsider?

352
00:31:03,190 --> 00:31:05,470
Don't you regard me as your daughter?

353
00:31:06,300 --> 00:31:10,350
I still feel uncomfortable.

354
00:31:10,350 --> 00:31:12,970
It's almost done. I'll be finished soon.

355
00:31:13,620 --> 00:31:15,810
So talktive.

356
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:21,410
How can you be so clumsy?

357
00:31:21,410 --> 00:31:23,300
Look what you did.

358
00:31:24,790 --> 00:31:28,360
Is it so hard to peel some garlic?

359
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:31,410
- That's why our life is so miserable. - Mom. You have a phone call.

360
00:31:31,410 --> 00:31:34,190
Don't nag me.

361
00:31:34,750 --> 00:31:35,750
- Ah. - Hello.

362
00:31:35,750 --> 00:31:39,680
Hey, the girl's side seem to like Do Hoon.

363
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:45,700
What did Do Hoon say? They're willing to arrange an office to Do Hoon.

364
00:31:45,700 --> 00:31:48,410
Hold on, I'll give the phone to her.

365
00:31:49,040 --> 00:31:50,640
Mother, it's for you.

366
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:53,860
Is garlic more important than me?

367
00:31:53,860 --> 00:31:54,830
Yes, garlic is more important than you.

368
00:31:54,830 --> 00:32:00,830
- I'm your husband! - Hello.

369
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,560
Oh.

370
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:08,290
I'll call you later.

371
00:32:28,100 --> 00:32:30,900
How can I be so sleepy.

372
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:34,440
Yoo Jung, that's enough.

373
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:38,560
Sour apples make us burp all night.

374
00:32:41,600 --> 00:32:42,670
Okay.

375
00:32:45,600 --> 00:32:47,080
What a pity！

376
00:32:47,560 --> 00:32:50,170
You couldn't see Do Hoon today.

377
00:32:51,170 --> 00:32:55,430
It's okay. I came here to see you.

378
00:33:01,010 --> 00:33:03,110
I'll leave now. Have a good rest.

379
00:33:03,110 --> 00:33:04,340
Are you leaving?

380
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:10,760
Don't come too often.

381
00:33:10,830 --> 00:33:14,120
It's not good for your reputation.

382
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:17,460
I'll leave now.

383
00:33:17,460 --> 00:33:18,220
OK.

384
00:33:18,220 --> 00:33:19,640
Take care.

385
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:30,180
You can't make use of our son.

386
00:33:30,760 --> 00:33:33,330
What are you talking about?

387
00:33:35,820 --> 00:33:38,490
She has to handel everything herself,

388
00:33:38,900 --> 00:33:42,030
since her mother passed away when she was young.

389
00:33:46,150 --> 00:33:47,440
Delicious.

390
00:33:58,570 --> 00:33:59,690
Okay.

391
00:34:00,150 --> 00:34:01,250
Thank you.

392
00:34:04,170 --> 00:34:06,680
Thanks.

393
00:34:07,820 --> 00:34:09,020
Take care.

394
00:34:11,010 --> 00:34:12,080
Who is that?

395
00:34:13,740 --> 00:34:16,550
I want to expand the shop to the warehouse,

396
00:34:16,860 --> 00:34:18,340
and renovate it.

397
00:34:18,340 --> 00:34:19,610
Renovate?

398
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:22,360
You always say that you don't have any money.

399
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:23,260
Where is the money from?

400
00:34:23,260 --> 00:34:25,180
I'm not asking for your money.

401
00:34:25,660 --> 00:34:28,400
You're marrying a prosecutor.

402
00:34:28,460 --> 00:34:30,520
We should at least have a decent house.

403
00:34:30,580 --> 00:34:33,550
I'm not marrying a prosecutor. I'm marrying Do Hoon.

404
00:34:38,200 --> 00:34:41,680
I heard that a girl needs 3 keys,

405
00:34:41,680 --> 00:34:44,040
to marry a prosecutor.

406
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:46,740
I have no money.

407
00:34:51,650 --> 00:34:53,180
I have a beautiful face.

408
00:34:53,730 --> 00:34:56,090
I have a nice figure.

409
00:34:56,090 --> 00:34:57,780
And I have a kind heart.

410
00:34:58,120 --> 00:35:00,440
I think these three can equal to the three keys.

411
00:35:00,740 --> 00:35:02,360
I saved you a lot of money.

412
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:04,800
Stop being silly.

413
00:35:06,730 --> 00:35:08,030
Don't drink that.

414
00:35:08,630 --> 00:35:11,260
Drink those after the expiration date.

415
00:35:12,540 --> 00:35:16,120
Dad. How can you have the heart to let me drink it?

416
00:35:16,180 --> 00:35:17,200
Why are you yelling at me?

417
00:35:17,260 --> 00:35:19,270
It's still okay to drink.

418
00:35:19,270 --> 00:35:20,410
I won't drink it.

419
00:35:20,610 --> 00:35:23,060
I won't drink it. Drink it yourself.

420
00:35:24,020 --> 00:35:25,090
What's wrong with her?

421
00:37:18,520 --> 00:37:19,560
Yoo Jung!

422
00:37:22,190 --> 00:37:23,380
What is it?

423
00:37:25,470 --> 00:37:27,240
Did Do Hoon give that to you?

424
00:37:30,040 --> 00:37:32,660
Why didn't you tell me just now?

425
00:37:34,900 --> 00:37:38,060
Have you decided on the date?

426
00:37:41,340 --> 00:37:43,880
We haven't discussed anything specific yet.

427
00:37:46,470 --> 00:37:47,950
Do Hoon is here.

428
00:37:48,520 --> 00:37:50,000
Come on out.

429
00:38:04,340 --> 00:38:05,620
Where are we going?

430
00:38:06,550 --> 00:38:09,890
It's not convenient here. Get in the car, please.

431
00:38:09,890 --> 00:38:10,950
Why?

432
00:38:11,350 --> 00:38:12,300
Just tell me directly what you want to say.

433
00:38:12,300 --> 00:38:14,060
Don't bring me to somewhere strange.

434
00:38:14,120 --> 00:38:15,350
Get in the car, please.

435
00:38:42,300 --> 00:38:43,870
How long should I wait?

436
00:38:43,870 --> 00:38:45,640
I have a lesson soon.

437
00:38:46,150 --> 00:38:47,180
Min Joo!

438
00:39:00,670 --> 00:39:01,750
Sorry.

439
00:39:02,320 --> 00:39:05,980
My father's running late because of his party meeting.

440
00:39:08,750 --> 00:39:10,950
You don't have to be sorry.

441
00:39:15,370 --> 00:39:17,170
Mr. Park is here.

442
00:39:19,210 --> 00:39:21,460
See? My tutor is here.

443
00:39:22,280 --> 00:39:25,710
Thanks to you, I couldn't have dinner.

444
00:39:26,090 --> 00:39:28,540
Steward, prepare some snacks for her.

445
00:39:28,540 --> 00:39:29,530
Okay.

446
00:39:33,100 --> 00:39:35,160
I'll arrange another date.

447
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:37,250
You'll become our family member soon.

448
00:39:37,700 --> 00:39:40,580
We'll have plenty of time to eat together.

449
00:39:47,310 --> 00:39:52,050
Sir, my father has an election in his district in October.

450
00:39:53,930 --> 00:39:59,550
How about announcing our marriage before that?

451
00:40:04,280 --> 00:40:07,540
Sounds good to me.

452
00:40:11,160 --> 00:40:12,150
Have some more.

453
00:40:12,150 --> 00:40:13,420
That's okay.

454
00:40:18,100 --> 00:40:21,420
Why is it so hard to eat with family?

455
00:40:22,010 --> 00:40:25,100
Madam, there's no family here.

456
00:40:31,520 --> 00:40:32,750
The soup is too salty.

457
00:40:33,600 --> 00:40:34,820
Is it?

458
00:40:35,520 --> 00:40:37,760
Mr. Yun, she said the soup is salty.

459
00:40:38,280 --> 00:40:40,920
How come you can't satisfy my fiancee?

460
00:40:41,440 --> 00:40:42,840
Sorry, miss.

461
00:40:43,010 --> 00:40:44,270
I'll make a new one.

462
00:40:44,270 --> 00:40:45,860
It's okay, Mr. Yun.

463
00:40:47,880 --> 00:40:50,090
We have plenty of time to work on it.

464
00:40:50,250 --> 00:40:51,660
Se Yeon!

465
00:40:51,710 --> 00:40:53,490
I'm your future wife.

466
00:40:55,600 --> 00:40:57,240
You should call me more gently.

467
00:41:08,840 --> 00:41:10,000
Do you remember here?

468
00:41:13,270 --> 00:41:14,930
When we first came here,

469
00:41:14,930 --> 00:41:18,000
you were working outside all day long, and your face was tanned.

470
00:41:18,560 --> 00:41:20,760
So you didn't want to take a picture.

471
00:41:24,980 --> 00:41:27,500
That was taken on our first date.

472
00:41:27,940 --> 00:41:30,680
We were wearing matching shirts.

473
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:32,700
And that one is

474
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:34,870
when I passed my bar exa,

475
00:41:34,870 --> 00:41:38,930
you were drunk and singing, I took it secretly.

476
00:41:39,860 --> 00:41:42,260
Although that's good, don't do it again.

477
00:41:42,860 --> 00:41:45,010
What do you want to say?

478
00:41:54,330 --> 00:41:57,310
Yoo Jung, I'm sorry that I went on a blind date.

479
00:41:57,850 --> 00:41:59,940
And it's my fault not telling you the truth.

480
00:42:00,330 --> 00:42:02,550
I'll never do it again.

481
00:42:03,210 --> 00:42:07,090
It's just a stupid thing my mother arranged.

482
00:42:07,550 --> 00:42:09,490
Do you know what day it is today?

483
00:42:11,270 --> 00:42:13,660
We've been dating for seven years.

484
00:42:14,650 --> 00:42:16,060
But for you,

485
00:42:16,660 --> 00:42:18,770
I could not make such an accomplishment.

486
00:42:19,760 --> 00:42:21,200
The things you have done for me,

487
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:23,330
I'll never forget till death.

488
00:42:24,680 --> 00:42:26,500
No, I'll never forget even after my death.

489
00:42:36,270 --> 00:42:37,550
Yoo Jung.

490
00:42:39,340 --> 00:42:42,720
Will you marry me?

491
00:43:29,440 --> 00:43:31,910
I'm a mess, aren't I?

492
00:43:32,470 --> 00:43:36,340
You are, but you're still pretty.

493
00:43:52,320 --> 00:43:54,410
Do you like me?

494
00:43:59,040 --> 00:44:02,800
Huh? I know you don't.

495
00:44:04,000 --> 00:44:06,710
Why do you want to marry me?

496
00:44:06,710 --> 00:44:08,970
I'll do whatever you want.

497
00:44:11,310 --> 00:44:18,760
Really? What I want is you.

498
00:44:19,410 --> 00:44:21,220
What's wrong with you?

499
00:44:23,550 --> 00:44:25,590
The soup was that salty?

500
00:44:25,980 --> 00:44:29,430
I don't care who I marry.

501
00:44:29,430 --> 00:44:34,050
I'm going to end up with someone that my father finds for me.

502
00:44:34,960 --> 00:44:37,220
You are no different than me.

503
00:44:39,550 --> 00:44:42,660
What you said is right.

504
00:44:42,660 --> 00:44:47,950
I'd rather marry someone I knew than a total stranger.

505
00:44:54,360 --> 00:44:56,430
Don't push yourself too hard.

506
00:44:57,220 --> 00:45:01,630
We're no match for our parents.

507
00:45:02,450 --> 00:45:06,500
You even broke up with Seo Ji Hee, the love of your life.

508
00:45:08,210 --> 00:45:11,470
Even if you get married,

509
00:45:11,470 --> 00:45:15,060
how long do you think you two would've survived without money?

510
00:45:21,070 --> 00:45:27,090
I haven't broken up with her. Don't talk nonsense.

511
00:45:27,090 --> 00:45:31,830
Are you going to marry her, then?

512
00:45:32,920 --> 00:45:37,290
Then go. Tell your father what you want.

513
00:45:37,290 --> 00:45:38,990
You can't do it.

514
00:45:40,770 --> 00:45:42,870
You thought you'd die without her.

515
00:45:42,870 --> 00:45:44,850
Yet, you've lived for 6 months without her.

516
00:45:44,850 --> 00:45:48,470
However, without your father's money,

517
00:45:48,470 --> 00:45:50,220
you wouldn't survive a day.

518
00:45:52,120 --> 00:45:54,570
Just accept the reality.

519
00:45:54,570 --> 00:45:57,910
Do you think your father will spoil you forever?

520
00:45:57,910 --> 00:46:05,860
You suck.

521
00:47:23,910 --> 00:47:27,000
Yoo Jung, I love you. We'll be happy together.

522
00:47:36,800 --> 00:47:39,440
Let me take a picture of you two.

523
00:47:40,660 --> 00:47:42,920
One, two, three.

524
00:47:44,020 --> 00:47:45,530
Congratulations!

525
00:48:12,210 --> 00:48:15,370
Father, I have something to tell you.

526
00:48:16,030 --> 00:48:21,340
Shin Sang Hoon! That bastard!

527
00:48:21,340 --> 00:48:26,530
How dare he stood me up!

528
00:48:27,920 --> 00:48:33,280
He's well known for treating those who are lower than him badly.

529
00:48:33,720 --> 00:48:35,680
Lower than him?

530
00:48:35,680 --> 00:48:38,450
Listen to me carefully!

531
00:48:38,450 --> 00:48:42,760
I need his reputation at the moment,

532
00:48:42,760 --> 00:48:47,630
but he'll be begging for my help soon.

533
00:48:47,630 --> 00:48:51,190
Money talks!

534
00:48:51,190 --> 00:48:52,900
You're right.

535
00:48:54,960 --> 00:48:57,680
This marriage isn't for your happiness.

536
00:48:58,050 --> 00:49:00,800
The rumor of us becoming Congressman Shin's in-laws

537
00:49:00,800 --> 00:49:02,740
have already increased the value of our stock.

538
00:49:02,740 --> 00:49:04,870
Name the day quickly.

539
00:49:07,600 --> 00:49:14,380
Can I divorce after the marriage?

540
00:49:16,740 --> 00:49:19,150
You must be crazy.

541
00:49:19,150 --> 00:49:27,670
Who is that? Ji Hee?

542
00:49:29,260 --> 00:49:32,600
Is that you? Ji Hee, answer me.

543
00:49:32,600 --> 00:49:34,270
Ji Hee! I know it's you.

544
00:49:34,270 --> 00:49:35,490
Ji Hee, where are you?

545
00:49:35,490 --> 00:49:37,510
Jo Min Hyuk!

546
00:49:37,510 --> 00:49:39,830
Pull yourself together.

547
00:49:59,650 --> 00:50:02,700
Hello, where is this?

548
00:50:02,700 --> 00:50:04,960
This is Art Cafe.

549
00:50:16,150 --> 00:50:17,700
Why isn't it working?

550
00:50:17,700 --> 00:50:20,710
- It's not? - That's strange.

551
00:50:20,710 --> 00:50:22,750
- Wait a moment. - OK.

552
00:50:29,390 --> 00:50:36,300
Yes, I'm almost there.

553
00:51:20,030 --> 00:51:25,310
What should we do?

554
00:51:28,050 --> 00:51:30,930
What the...

555
00:51:41,090 --> 00:51:42,840
Let's go!

556
00:51:42,840 --> 00:51:46,890
It's not easy to drive it in the rain.

557
00:52:04,720 --> 00:52:07,470
- Thank you. - What?

558
00:52:08,820 --> 00:52:11,590
For marrying me.

559
00:52:11,590 --> 00:52:15,170
Don't say that. It's you who marry me.

560
00:52:17,240 --> 00:52:18,710
I love you.

561
00:52:23,590 --> 00:52:25,380
I love you.

562
00:52:26,740 --> 00:52:29,150
Stop staring at me.

563
00:52:29,150 --> 00:52:31,180
I love you.

564
00:53:48,410 --> 00:53:50,860
Yoo Jung, are you okay?

565
00:53:50,860 --> 00:53:52,750
Yes.

566
00:53:53,990 --> 00:53:55,960
What did we hit?

567
00:53:55,960 --> 00:53:57,860
I don't know.

568
00:53:59,230 --> 00:54:00,620
It's too dangerous. You stay here.

569
00:54:00,620 --> 00:54:01,860
I'll see what happened.

570
00:54:01,860 --> 00:54:02,860
Do Hoon.

571
00:54:02,860 --> 00:54:04,840
Listen to me. It's okay.

572
00:54:48,890 --> 00:54:55,410
Do Hoon! Do Hoon!

573
00:54:55,410 --> 00:54:56,940
I told you to stay inside.

574
00:54:56,940 --> 00:54:58,600
What was it?

575
00:55:05,440 --> 00:55:09,430
Thank god.

576
00:55:09,430 --> 00:55:11,100
- Let's get out of here. - Wait.

577
00:55:11,100 --> 00:55:13,780
Let's move it. Other cars might hit it.

578
00:55:37,970 --> 00:55:40,340
Should we call the insurance company?

579
00:55:40,340 --> 00:55:42,370
No.

580
00:55:42,370 --> 00:55:43,480
I think we should.

581
00:55:43,480 --> 00:55:46,840
It's okay.

582
00:55:50,210 --> 00:55:53,170
I had two glasses of wine earlier.

583
00:55:53,170 --> 00:55:55,440
I don't want to make things complicated.

584
00:55:55,440 --> 00:55:57,920
That seems to be an abandoned car.

585
00:55:57,920 --> 00:56:01,000
Yes.

586
00:56:02,370 --> 00:56:05,230
I think this is a good sign.

587
00:56:05,230 --> 00:56:09,270
When the car lost control, I thought we'd die.

588
00:56:09,270 --> 00:56:12,610
Yet, we're safe and sound.

589
00:56:15,500 --> 00:56:16,640
Are you okay?

590
00:56:16,640 --> 00:56:18,680
I'm fine.

591
00:56:18,680 --> 00:56:23,500
I think we'll live happily ever after.

592
00:56:26,630 --> 00:56:30,460
Sure we will.

593
00:56:30,460 --> 00:56:33,410
Right.

594
00:57:12,780 --> 00:57:15,700
Have you found her?

595
00:57:15,700 --> 00:57:18,370
Where are you?

596
00:57:39,820 --> 00:57:44,910
Do Hoon, your bumper's damaged. The windshield wipers are broken as well.

597
00:57:44,910 --> 00:57:46,020
Let's drive it to a garage.

598
00:57:46,020 --> 00:57:49,210
It'll cost a lot to fix it. The car is too old.

599
00:57:49,210 --> 00:57:50,420
I can buy a new one.

600
00:57:50,420 --> 00:57:53,760
No, we can get a few more years out of it.

601
00:57:53,760 --> 00:57:55,200
Leave it here. I'll fix it.

602
00:57:55,200 --> 00:57:59,340
I'll take care of it. Get inside.

603
00:57:59,340 --> 00:58:01,940
Okay.

604
00:58:13,120 --> 00:58:16,160
Drive carefully.

605
00:58:41,960 --> 00:58:42,660
Dad.

606
00:58:42,660 --> 00:58:43,610
What?

607
00:58:43,610 --> 00:58:45,370
He proposed to me.

608
00:58:45,370 --> 00:58:48,120
You already told me.

609
00:58:48,120 --> 00:58:54,830
I forgot. I just want to tell you again.

610
00:58:55,880 --> 00:58:59,340
What's wrong with your forehead? Are you hurt?

611
00:58:59,340 --> 00:59:01,650
I just bumped it.

612
00:59:01,650 --> 00:59:04,270
Let me see. It's swollen.

613
00:59:04,270 --> 00:59:06,450
Wait. I'll get some ice.

614
00:59:06,450 --> 00:59:08,650
I said I'm okay.

615
00:59:08,650 --> 00:59:11,730
Have a good sleep.

616
00:59:46,710 --> 00:59:50,440
Ji Hee! Ji Hee!

617
00:59:50,440 --> 00:59:51,870
You can't come in.

618
00:59:51,870 --> 00:59:54,280
Ji Hee! What happened?

619
00:59:54,280 --> 00:59:56,420
Ji Hee! Ji Hee!

620
00:59:56,420 --> 00:59:57,860
Kwang Soo, what happened?

621
00:59:57,860 --> 01:00:00,420
I think it was a hit-and-run.

622
01:00:06,730 --> 01:00:09,570
Ji Hee! Seo Ji Hee!

623
01:00:09,570 --> 01:00:13,100
Ji Hee! Ji Hee! Wake up.

624
01:00:13,100 --> 01:00:16,440
Ji Hee. Ji Hee!

625
01:00:16,440 --> 01:00:19,140
Ji Hee!

626
01:00:22,320 --> 01:00:26,300
Ji Hee. Ji Hee!

627
01:00:31,950 --> 01:00:34,600
I said I'd follow you to the end of the world.

628
01:00:34,600 --> 01:00:37,580
I said wherever you hid, I'd find you.

629
01:00:38,580 --> 01:00:41,530
I told you not to die without my permission.

630
01:00:45,740 --> 01:00:47,530
Don't die!

631
01:01:03,230 --> 01:01:05,560
Sorry, wait a moment.

632
01:01:18,120 --> 01:01:19,560
Come on!

633
01:02:20,070 --> 01:02:22,790
Next on secret love.

634
01:02:22,790 --> 01:02:24,740
- I found it. - Who is she?

635
01:02:24,740 --> 01:02:26,990
We have evidence.

636
01:02:26,990 --> 01:02:30,220
How dare you hurt my woman?

637
01:02:30,220 --> 01:02:32,820
I said I was driving.

638
01:02:32,820 --> 01:02:36,420
Please help my boyfriend.

639
01:02:36,420 --> 01:02:39,050
Here is your case. Her name is Kang Yoo Jung.

640
01:02:39,050 --> 01:02:40,150
Make her suffer.

641
01:02:40,150 --> 01:02:41,730
I'll drive.

642
01:02:41,730 --> 01:02:43,440
I'm worried about you.

643
01:02:43,440 --> 01:02:46,780
Do you know why you were arrested?

644
01:02:49,150 --> 01:02:50,920
Hey! Hit-and run!
